        "brand_heading": "From screens back to little hands",
        "brand_text": "<p>Most kids today learn to swipe before they learn to hold a crayon. That shift didn't sit right with our founder, Nidhi Sethia. During the 2020 lockdown, she watched screens take over playtime while the simple joy of making things by hand slipped away.</p><p>So she started small — a few screen-free DIY kits that gave children a fun way to explore, build and learn. What began as a handful of craft kits grew into Creste: a brand made to bring arts and crafts back into everyday life.</p><p>Today, every Creste kit is designed to feel exciting, never like a task — helping kids grow their curiosity, confidence and joy with their own two hands. We run Creste with one goal: to put real, hands-on creativity into every kit, workshop and experience.</p>",
